@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #F6F8FC
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction
title SD-BE-12 模块内分层与依赖方向
caption To-Be · Proposed · 实线表示源码依赖 · 虚线表示装配或端口实现

[HTTP / Worker 协议入口\ntransport] as In
[应用用例及公开门面\napplication] as App
[业务规则与值类型\ndomain] as Domain
interface "由用例定义的数据访问端口\napplication.port" as Port
[JDBC / SQL 映射\ninfrastructure] as Db
[Spring Boot 装配\nbootstrap] as Boot
database PostgreSQL as Pg

In --> App : 请求 DTO → 命令
App --> Domain : 快照 → 决策
App --> Port : 读取及持久化
Db ..|> Port : 实现
Db --> Pg
Boot ..> In
Boot ..> App
Boot ..> Db
note right of Domain
  纯 Java
  只使用业务值和规则
end note
@enduml
